   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-3-1-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What does SaaS stand for?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>System as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. SaaS stands for Software as a Service.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Software as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. SaaS means Software as a Service, like Lobe.ai or Azure Custom Vision for training models.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Security as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The first S in SaaS stands for Software, not Security.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
